	(text_box "BLACKPILL pin matching\n\nAll pins except P2-> 6,7,8,9 match\n6 - PB11\n7 - \n8 - \n9 - PC13\n\n\nOVERLAPPING pins not broken out beside USB:\nPA9/PA11: USART1 used in programming. Same pins as:\nPA11/PA12: USB used in programming\n\nON BOOT:\nPA11: USB_DM  PA9: USART1_TX\nPA12: USB_DP  PA10: USART1_RX\n\nPA3: USART2_RX\nPA2: USART2_TX\n\n\nPROGRAMMING\nUSART on pins PA9/PA10, PC10/PC11, or PA2/PA3\nI2C-bus on pins PB6/PB7 or PB10/PB11\nSPI on pins PA4/PA5/PA6/PA7 or PB12/PB13/PB14/PB15\nUSB on pins PA11/PA12"
